"Explorer tiles double in on-screen size with every zoom step, so a lower "
"value shows the grid when zoomed further out."
msgstr ""
"Explorer-Kacheln verdoppeln ihre Bildschirmgröße mit jeder Zoomstufe, ein"
" niedrigerer Wert zeigt das Gitter also auch weiter herausgezoomt an."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:8
msgid "Tile Source"
msgstr "Kachelquelle"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:10
msgid ""
"You can change the tile source to be whatever you like. Be aware that "
"different sources have different licensing constraints. It is on you to "
"make sure that you are allowed to use the tiles from the source that you "
"enter. See"
msgstr ""
"Du kannst die Kachelquelle beliebig ändern. Beachte, dass verschiedene "
"Quellen unterschiedliche Lizenzbedingungen haben. Es liegt an dir "
"sicherzustellen, dass du die Kacheln aus der eingegebenen Quelle "
"verwenden darfst. Siehe"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:11
msgid "this list of raster tile providers"
msgstr "diese Liste von Rasterkachelanbietern"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:11
msgid "for inspiration."
msgstr "zur Inspiration."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:16
msgid "Map tile URL"
msgstr "Kartenkachel-URL"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:18
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The URL must contain the placeholders {zoom}, {x} and {y}. The widespread"
" {z} is accepted as well and converted into {zoom}. Before saving, a "
"sample tile is downloaded to verify that the tile source works."
msgstr ""
"Die URL muss die Platzhalter {zoom}, {x} und {y} enthalten. Das "
"verbreitete {z} wird ebenfalls akzeptiert und in {zoom} umgewandelt. Vor "
"dem Speichern wird eine Beispielkachel heruntergeladen, um zu prüfen, ob "
"die Kachelquelle funktioniert."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:20
msgid "See the documentation on the map tile source."
msgstr "Siehe die Dokumentation zur Kartenkachelquelle."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:23
