msgstr ""

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:30
msgid ""
"These settings control how the Mapterhorn hillshade overlay is drawn over"
" the base map. Lower the opacity to make it subtler. The blend mode "
"determines how it combines with the map below: multiply darkens and suits"
" bright base maps, whereas screen lightens and suits dark base maps."
msgstr ""

